1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,216
Later, walls form from the edge inwards.

2
00:00:03,216 --> 00:00:06,757
In a coconut you can see both stages at once.

3
00:00:06,757 --> 00:00:09,427
The white meat is cellular endosperm.

4
00:00:09,427 --> 00:00:15,156
The coconut water is endosperm still in its free nuclear, liquid stage.

5
00:00:15,156 --> 00:00:16,432
Both are triploid.

